# facts.baillot.dev — agent-facts check() API (W8). Appended to /etc/caddy/Caddyfile by hand
# (ops/README.md → Caddy). DNS: facts.baillot.dev resolves through the *.baillot.dev wildcard to
# illouminus (A only, no AAAA; checked 2026-10-20), so no record of its own is needed.
#
# No `log` directive on purpose: Caddy keeps no access log for this site, so caller IPs never reach
# a disk (spec 03: never store or log raw IPs; uvicorn runs with --no-access-log for the same
# reason). Caddy does not trust an incoming X-Forwarded-For (no trusted_proxies here) and sends the
# caller's address itself; the API believes X-Forwarded-For only from 127.0.0.1/::1.
facts.baillot.dev {
	encode zstd gzip
	request_body {
		max_size 16KB
	}
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8795
	header {
		Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000"
		X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
		Referrer-Policy "no-referrer"
		-Server
	}
}
